<p id="S2.p9.2" class="ltx_p">and there are exactly <math id="S2.p9.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k+1</annotation></semantics></math> of these sets.</p>
