<p id="S2.p23.2" class="ltx_p">Therefore, for <math id="S2.p23.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\geq 2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\geq 2</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
